@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Formatting preserves unchanged surrounding code.** Formatting edits retain shared leading and trailing text, including Unicode and CRLF boundaries, so token rewrites in one function do not replace untouched functions after it. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Keep member suggestions while typing.** Completion recovers enclosing function and class scopes before their closing braces are written, preserving visibility and typed chains. Strict membership checks against broad or unavailable object types retain valid member suggestions. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Rename preserves import bindings.** Class renames update every matching import while retaining explicit aliases and choosing available names for collisions. Moving grouped imports keeps unrelated bindings and surrounding code. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
